<title>GERMANY: Krupp to hold news conference Friday.</title>
<headline>Krupp to hold news conference Friday.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walter Cromme, chief executive of Germany's Krupp group, will hold a news conference at 1000 GMT on Friday to comment on the steel business merger with Thyssen AG, the company said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Thyssen's supervisory board on Thursday approved the merger, whose associated redundancy costs Thyssen said would be fully borne by Fried. Krupp AG Hoesch-Krupp.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097 150</p>
</text>
